#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 trunk5 stable5
#: index.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This <acronym>KIO</acronym> displays your bookmarks as a nice and functional"
" &HTML; page. You access it typing <userinput>bookmarks:/</userinput> in the"
" &konqueror; location bar."
msgstr ""
"Este <acronym>KIO</acronym> amosa os marcadores nunha páxina &HTML;. Pode"
" acceder a ela escribindo <userinput>bookmarks:/</userinput> na barra de"
" enderezo de &konqueror;."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 trunk5 stable5
#: index.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The content and layout of the page is configurable. Just point &konqueror; to"
" <userinput>bookmarks:/config</userinput> to launch the configuration dialog."
msgstr ""
"O contido e a disposición da páxina pode configurarse. Abra <userinput"
">bookmarks:/config</userinput> en &konqueror; para iniciar o diálogo de"
" configuración."
